@format 1
@id tabs.move
@title Move tab
@area Tabs
@entry input
@summary Reorder one tab by dragging it to a resolved insertion index.
@flow TB
@related tabs.select

@alias toolbar = Cadroue.UIShell.PControlBar.PToolbar
@alias tabset = Cadroue.UIShell.PControlBar.LTabset

[input] Tab drag begins <input>
- Capture the pressed tab and drag origin @ toolbar.PTabPressHandle(...)
> track

[track] Resolve insertion <decision>
- Activate dragging after threshold and resolve the target index @ toolbar.PTabMoveHandle(...)
? "Target index is unchanged" > unchanged
? "A different insertion index is reached" > reorder

[reorder] Reorder tab <process>
- Move the record in the tab set and update derived titles @ tabset.LTabsetMove(...)
> result

[result] Tab moved <output>
= Visible and persisted tab order use the new index.

[unchanged] Order unchanged <output>
= The tab remains at its current index.
